  <li class="wmd-list-item">User sees &quot;Verify to Message&quot; prompt on detail screen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User returns to home screen, taps &quot;Verify Now&quot; in banner</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigate to Journey #02 (Trust Level Verification)</li>
