  <p class="wmd-paragraph">📍 Local {.badge-local}</p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Looking for Nepali roommate to share 2BR apartment near UTD campus. Clean, quiet environment. Rent is $800/month including utilities... <button class="wmd-button wmd-outline">View More</button></p>
