  <p class="wmd-paragraph">❤️ 24    💬 5    ✉️ Message</p>
</div>
<div class="wmd-container-card">
  <h3 class="wmd-h3">Hiring Line Cooks - Nepali Rest.</h3>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">🌐 Global {.badge-global}</p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">We&#039;re hiring experienced line cooks for our new Nepali restaurant...</p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">💼 Jobs   🤝 Help</p>
  <hr class="wmd-separator" />
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">❤️ 8    💬 2    ✉️ Message</p>
</div>
<button class="wmd-button wmd-fab wmd-button-primary wmd-state-semi-disabled">+</button>
