    <td class="wmd-table-cell wmd-align-left">Respective tab</td>
  </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">State Management</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Real-time subscription to conversations table for new message updates</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Unread count synced from conversation_participants.unread_count</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Pagination: 20 items per page, infinite scroll</li>
</ul>
