<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">The Messages tab content. Shows all active conversations sorted by most recent message. Each row displays the other participant&#039;s name, last message preview, timestamp, unread badge, and linked post context. This is the hub for all in-app communication.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Quick overview of all ongoing conversations</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Easy identification of unread messages</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Post context visible so user remembers what the conversation is about</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">One-tap access to any conversation thread</li>
</ul>
