<h3 class="wmd-h3">Identifiers</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Route: /messages</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">iOS: ConversationListScreen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Android: ConversationListFragment</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Data Requirements</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>API Query:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="sql">SELECT c.*, cp.unread_count,
  other_cp.name as other_name, other_cp.user_id as other_user_id
FROM conversations c
JOIN conversation_participants cp ON c.id = cp.conversation_id
JOIN conversation_participants other_cp ON c.id = other_cp.conversation_id
WHERE cp.user_id = {current_user_id}
  AND other_cp.user_id != {current_user_id}
ORDER BY c.last_message_time DESC
LIMIT 20;</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Data per row:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">conversation_id — for navigation</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">other_user_name — display name</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">other_user_id — for avatar initials</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">post_id, post_category, post_title — post context</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">last_message — preview text</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">last_message_time — timestamp</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">unread_count — badge number</li>
</ul>
