  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Conversation List Screen</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 07 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-02-19
