<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">The Messages tab content. Shows all active conversations sorted by most recent message. Each row displays the other participant&#039;s name, last message preview, timestamp, unread badge, and linked post context. This is the hub for all in-app communication.</p>
