  <li class="wmd-list-item">New message bubble animates in from bottom</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Message list auto-scrolls to bottom (if user was at bottom)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If user scrolled up: show &quot;New message ↓&quot; floating pill at bottom</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Mark message as read (update read field, read_at timestamp)</li>
