<h2 class="wmd-h2">Data Requirements</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Initial Load:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="sql">SELECT * FROM messages
WHERE conversation_id = {conversation_id}
ORDER BY timestamp ASC
LIMIT 50 OFFSET (total - 50);</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Real-time Subscription:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="typescript">supabase.channel(&#039;messages:conversation_id&#039;)
  .on(&#039;postgres_changes&#039;, {
    event: &#039;INSERT&#039;,
    schema: &#039;public&#039;,
    table: &#039;messages&#039;,
    filter: `conversation_id=eq.${conversationId}`
  }, handleNewMessage)
  .on(&#039;postgres_changes&#039;, {
    event: &#039;UPDATE&#039;,
    schema: &#039;public&#039;,
    table: &#039;messages&#039;,
    filter: `conversation_id=eq.${conversationId}`
  }, handleMessageUpdate)
  .subscribe();</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Send Message:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="typescript">await supabase.from(&#039;messages&#039;).insert({
  conversation_id,
  sender_id: currentUser.id,
  text: messageText,
  type: &#039;text&#039;,
});</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Mark as Read (on thread open):</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="typescript">await supabase.from(&#039;messages&#039;)
  .update({ read: true, read_at: new Date().toISOString() })
  .eq(&#039;conversation_id&#039;, conversationId)
  .neq(&#039;sender_id&#039;, currentUser.id)
  .eq(&#039;read&#039;, false);

await supabase.from(&#039;conversation_participants&#039;)
  .update({ unread_count: 0 })
  .eq(&#039;conversation_id&#039;, conversationId)
  .eq(&#039;user_id&#039;, currentUser.id);</code></pre>
