## Platform-Specific Differences

| Aspect | iOS | Android |
|--------|-----|---------|
| **Photo Picker** | Bottom sheet | Bottom sheet (Material) |
| **Camera UI** | Native iOS camera | Native Android camera |
| **Photo Library** | Native Photos app picker | System photo picker (Material) |
