<body class="wmd-root wmd-material">
  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Location Change Prompt</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 12 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-02-19
<strong>Journey:</strong> <a href="../user-journeys/location/01-location-permission-and-detection.md">01-location-permission-and-detection</a> - Scenario C, Step 2
<strong>Feature:</strong> <a href="../features/dynamic-location-management.md">dynamic-location-management</a> - Features L.3, L.4, L.8
<strong>Story:</strong> As a traveling user, I want the app to notice I'm in a different city and give me the option to browse local content or keep my home feed.
<strong>Platforms:</strong> Mobile + Web</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">A bottom sheet (mobile) or modal (web) that appears when the app detects the user is in a different metro area than their active location. Gives users three clear choices: browse temporarily, update permanently, or dismiss.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Inform user that a location mismatch was detected</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Provide clear, understandable options without jargon</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Allow snoozing to prevent prompt fatigue</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Not block app usage (user can dismiss and continue)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Visual Wireframe</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Mobile — Bottom Sheet</h3>
<div class="wmd-container-modal">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">It looks like you're in
<strong>Houston</strong></p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Would you like to see community posts from this area?</p>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-button-primary">Browse Houston</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-outline">Update My Location</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-secondary">Keep Dallas-Fort Worth</button>
  <hr class="wmd-separator" />
  <ul class="wmd-list">
  <label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Don&#039;t ask again for 24 hours</span>
  </label>
</ul>
</div>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Web — Centered Modal</h3>
<div class="wmd-container-modal wmd-web">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">📍</p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">It looks like you're in
<strong>Houston</strong></p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Would you like to see community posts from this area?</p>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-button-primary">Browse Houston</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-outline">Update My Location</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-secondary">Keep Dallas-Fort Worth</button>
  <hr class="wmd-separator" />
  <ul class="wmd-list">
  <label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Don&#039;t ask again for 24 hours</span>
  </label>
</ul>
</div>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Interactive States</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Action: &quot;Browse [Metro]&quot; tapped</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>System behavior:</strong></p>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Bottom sheet dismisses (slide down animation)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Home screen header updates: &quot;[Metro Name]&quot; + &quot;(Visiting)&quot; tag</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Feed refreshes with posts from detected metro area</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If snooze checkbox was checked → save snooze record</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Set manual override flag (no more GPS prompts this session)</li>
</ol>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Visiting indicator on home screen:</strong></p>
<div class="wmd-container-card">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Houston (Visiting) ▼   🔍 🔔</p>
</div>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">&quot;(Visiting)&quot; shown in lighter color / smaller font next to metro name</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Action: &quot;Update My Location&quot; tapped</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>System behavior:</strong></p>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Bottom sheet content transitions to &quot;Save Location&quot; sub-view:</li>
</ol>
<div class="wmd-container-modal">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">You're now viewing posts from
<strong>Houston-The Woodlands, TX</strong></p>
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Save this as a named location?</p>
  <input type="text" class="wmd-input" placeholder="Houston" />
  <p class="wmd-paragraph">Suggested: Home Work School</p>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-button-primary">Save Location</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-secondary">Skip</button>
</div>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If user has 5 saved locations already:<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Show: &quot;You&#039;ve reached the max of 5 locations.&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">&quot;Manage Locations&quot; link instead of save option</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Metro is still updated in DB, just not saved as named location</li>
</ul></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If &quot;Save Location&quot; tapped:<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Create entry in user_saved_locations</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Dismiss bottom sheet</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Feed refreshes with new metro</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Set manual override flag</li>
</ul></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If &quot;Skip&quot; tapped:<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Metro updated in DB (users.metro_area_id)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">No saved location created</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Dismiss bottom sheet</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Feed refreshes</li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Action: &quot;Keep [Current]&quot; tapped or sheet dismissed</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>System behavior:</strong></p>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Bottom sheet dismisses</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Feed unchanged (stays on current metro)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If snooze checkbox was checked → save snooze record for detected metro</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">No manual override flag set (GPS will check again on next foreground)</li>
</ol>
