    <tr>
    <td class="wmd-table-cell wmd-align-left"><strong>"Turn On" action (web)</strong></td>
    <td class="wmd-table-cell wmd-align-left">Re-triggers browser geolocation prompt</td>
  </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Accessibility</h2>
<ul class="wmd-list">
