<body class="wmd-root wmd-material">
  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Create Post (Reddit-Style)</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 14 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-02-19
<strong>Journey:</strong> Post Creation User Journey
<strong>Story:</strong> As a verified (Level 1+) user, I want to create a post with a title, body, and tags so I can share information with my local community (or globally if I'm a premium user).</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">A single-screen, Reddit-style post creation form. Users write a title and body, select 1-3 tags, optionally add photos, and premium users can toggle global visibility.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
