<h2 class="wmd-h2">User Interactions</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Primary Flow (Create Local Post)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps FAB (+) on home screen → Navigate to this screen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User types title → Character counter appears at 120+</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User types body → Textarea expands as needed</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps 1-3 tag chips → Chips highlight in tag color</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User optionally adds photos → Thumbnails appear</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Post&quot; button → Loading spinner, then success</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Success: Navigate back to home screen, new post visible at top</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Premium Global Post)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Steps 1-5 same as above</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User toggles &quot;Post Globally&quot; ON → Toggle animation</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Post&quot; button → Post created with is_global = true</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Success: Post visible in all metro area feeds with 🌐 badge</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Emergency Tag)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Steps 1-3 same as above</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User selects &quot;Emergency&quot; tag → Warning banner appears</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User reads warning → Post will require moderator approval</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Post&quot; button → Post status = &quot;pending&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Success toast: &quot;Your emergency post has been submitted for moderator review.&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigate back to home screen → Post NOT visible until approved</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Cancel with Content)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User has entered some content</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps Cancel/✕</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Confirmation dialog appears:<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Title: &quot;Discard Post?&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Message: &quot;You have unsaved changes. Are you sure you want to discard this post?&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Buttons: &quot;Discard&quot; (destructive) and &quot;Keep Editing&quot; (default)</li>
</ul></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Discard&quot; → Navigate back, content lost</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Keep Editing&quot; → Dialog closes, continue editing</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Cancel Empty)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps Cancel/✕ with no content entered</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigate back immediately (no confirmation needed)</li>
</ol>
