<p class="wmd-paragraph">A single-screen, Reddit-style post creation form. Users write a title and body, select 1-3 tags, optionally add photos, and premium users can toggle global visibility.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Simple, fast post creation (&lt; 60 seconds for typical post)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Mandatory tags for content organization (1–3 tags)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Optional photo attachments</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Premium users can toggle global visibility</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Emergency tag triggers moderation disclaimer</li>
