---

### Phase 3: Viewing Post Details and Comments

#### Step 5: Tap on Post to View Full Details
**User Action:** Rajesh taps on a post card from "Sita Gurung" to see full details.

**System Response:** Navigate to PostDetailScreen.

**User Sees:**
