                          │ Compare detected  ├──────────► No action
                          │ vs active metro   │            (feed unchanged)
                          └────────┬──────────┘
                                   │ Different
                                   ▼
                          ┌──────────────────┐     Yes
                          │ Snooze active for ├──────────► No action
                          │ this metro area?  │
                          └────────┬──────────┘
                                   │ No
                                   ▼
