  <li class="wmd-list-item">From WhatsApp: Minimalist design, familiar chat patterns</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">From Airbnb: Verification flow, clear photo guidelines</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">What Makes Nepally Unique</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
