  <li class="wmd-list-item">Easing: Ease-in-out cubic bezier</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Direction:<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Forward navigation: Slide in from right</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Back navigation: Slide out to right</li>
</ul></li>
