  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ Native navigation patterns</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ System fonts (San Francisco)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Android Material Design</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ 48dp minimum touch targets</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ Material Icons</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ Elevation and shadows</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">✅ Roboto font family</li>
</ul>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Design Inspiration</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">References</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Nextdoor - Local feed design, trust badges, community feel</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">WhatsApp - Simple, clean, familiar to Nepali users</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Airbnb - Verification UI, trust indicators, clean cards</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">What We&#039;re Borrowing</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">From Nextdoor: Trust level badges, local-first navigation</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">From WhatsApp: Minimalist design, familiar chat patterns</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">From Airbnb: Verification flow, clear photo guidelines</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">What Makes Nepally Unique</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Metro-first location model (not neighborhood or city)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">3-tier trust system (Level 0, 1, 2)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Tag-based post engine (Reddit-style)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Premium subscription for global posts</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Subtle Nepali cultural touches</li>
</ul>
