<h3 class="wmd-h3">API Integration — Google OAuth Flow</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Continue with Google&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Set isLoading = true, show spinner</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Initiate OAuth: GoogleSignIn.signIn()</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Redirect to Google consent screen (external)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User approves → Google redirects back with OAuth token</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">App receives token</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Call API: POST /auth/signup/google with token</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">API returns: { user_id, session_token }</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Store session token securely</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigate to Screen 03 (ZIP Code Entry)</li>
</ol>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Error Handling:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">OAuth cancelled → toast, reset isLoading</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">OAuth error → error banner, reset isLoading</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Network error → error banner with retry</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Server error → generic error banner</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Performance</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Pre-load Google SDK for instant OAuth (load on app launch)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Icons: vector or 2×/3× PNG for crisp display</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Animate cards on screen entry for polish (stagger fade-in)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Design System Components Used</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Large Button (Card style) — adapted from Primary Button</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">H1 Typography (34pt/sp Bold)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Body Typography (17pt/16sp Regular)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Caption Typography (13pt/12sp Regular)</li>
</ul>
