  <li class="wmd-list-item">OAuth cancelled → toast, reset isLoading</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">OAuth error → error banner, reset isLoading</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Network error → error banner with retry</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Server error → generic error banner</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Performance</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Pre-load Google SDK for instant OAuth (load on app launch)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Icons: vector or 2×/3× PNG for crisp display</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Animate cards on screen entry for polish (stagger fade-in)</li>
</ul>
