<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">This screen captures the user&#039;s ZIP code to map them to their local US Census Metro Area. This is critical for Nepally&#039;s metro-first location model, ensuring users only see relevant local content.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Collect ZIP code for metro area mapping</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Explain why we need location (transparency)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Reassure users about privacy (exact address never shared)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Validate ZIP code in real-time</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Allow skip option for users who want to browse first</li>
</ul>
