<h3 class="wmd-h3">Database Query</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Real-time validation:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="sql">SELECT metro_area_id, metro_name, state
FROM metro_area_zipcodes
WHERE zip_code = &#039;75080&#039;;</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Update user record:</strong></p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="sql">UPDATE users
SET metro_area_id = &#039;dallas-fort-worth-arlington&#039;,
    zip_code = &#039;75080&#039;,
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = &#039;user_id&#039;;</code></pre>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Performance Considerations</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Debounce validation: Wait 300ms after 5th digit before API call (in case user deletes/retypes)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Cache metro area data: Store in memory for instant lookup</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Optimize API: ZIP validation should be &lt;500ms response time</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Keyboard handling: Ensure smooth keyboard animation, no lag</li>
</ul>
