  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Continue&quot; → Show loading spinner, call API</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">API returns metro area → Navigate to Screen 04 (Metro Confirmation)</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow: Skip</h3>
