  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip for now&quot; → Show confirmation dialog</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip Anyway&quot; → Set metro_area_id = null, proceed to tutorial</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Home screen (later) → Show &quot;Set your location to see local posts&quot; banner</li>
</ol>
