<h2 class="wmd-h2">User Interactions</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Primary Flow</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Screen loads → Numeric keyboard auto-appears, input field auto-focused</li>
