  <li class="wmd-list-item">User enters 5th digit → Real-time validation checks database</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Valid ZIP detected → Green checkmark appears, &quot;Continue&quot; button enables</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Continue&quot; → Show loading spinner, call API</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">API returns metro area → Navigate to Screen 04 (Metro Confirmation)</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow: Skip</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip for now&quot; → Show confirmation dialog</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip Anyway&quot; → Set metro_area_id = null, proceed to tutorial</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Home screen (later) → Show &quot;Set your location to see local posts&quot; banner</li>
</ol>
