<h2 class="wmd-h2">Content &amp; Localization</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Copy Requirements</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Title: Question format, friendly (&quot;Where are you located?&quot;)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Subtitle: Clear value proposition (why we need this)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Info Box: Explain metro areas + privacy reassurance (under 100 characters)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Error Messages: Helpful, action-oriented (tell user what to do)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">String Keys</h3>
