<h3 class="wmd-h3">Identifiers</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Route: /onboarding/zip-code</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">iOS: ZipCodeEntryViewController / ZipCodeEntryScreen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Android: ZipCodeEntryActivity / ZipCodeEntryFragment</li>
