### 3. ZIP Code Input Field

| Property | iOS | Android |
|----------|-----|---------|
| **Type** | Text Input (Numeric) | Text Input (Numeric) |
| **Label** | "Your ZIP Code" (13pt Regular, #757575) | "Your ZIP Code" (12sp floating label, #757575) |
