<strong>Purpose:</strong> Fetch member count for social proof</p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code data-lang="json">{
  &quot;metro_area_id&quot;: &quot;dallas-fort-worth-arlington&quot;,
  &quot;metro_name&quot;: &quot;Dallas-Fort Worth-Arlington&quot;,
  &quot;member_count&quot;: 2847,
  &quot;verified_count&quot;: 1203
}</code></pre>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Timing:</strong> Fetch during Screen 03 (ZIP validation) to avoid delay; fallback: show metro name without count</p>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Performance</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Use CSS/native animations (not JavaScript) for smooth 60fps</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Cache member count in memory</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Pass metro name via navigation params (no API call needed on this screen)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Use vector SVG for checkmark (crisp at all sizes)</li>
</ul>
