  <li class="wmd-list-item">Con: Clutters screen, may overwhelm</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Rec: Keep simple — just total member count</li>
</ul>
  <label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Should we add confetti animation?</span>
  </label><ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Pro: More celebratory, fun</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Con: May feel gimmicky, slows down onboarding</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Rec: A/B test — measure user sentiment</li>
</ul>
  <label class="wmd-checkbox">
