<h2 class="wmd-h2">User Interactions</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Primary Flow (Complete Tutorial)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User lands on Card 1 → Reads content (~10 seconds)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Next&quot; → Animate to Card 2 (300ms slide)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User reads Card 2 → ~10-15 seconds</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Next&quot; → Animate to Card 3 (300ms slide)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User reads Card 3 → ~15 seconds</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Get Started&quot; → Mark onboarding complete, navigate to Screen 06</li>
</ol>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Total Tutorial Time:</strong> 35-45 seconds for users who read everything</p>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Skip Tutorial)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User lands on Card 1 → Starts reading</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip&quot; → Confirmation dialog appears (if enabled)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Skip Tutorial&quot; → Navigate to Screen 06 immediately</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Onboarding marked complete (with flag: tutorial_skipped = true)</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Swipe Navigation)</h3>
