| **Font** | 22pt Semibold, San Francisco | 22sp Regular, Roboto |
| **Color** | #212121 (Almost Black) | #212121 |
| **Alignment** | Center | Center |
| **Max Width** | 320px | 320dp |
| **Semantic** | H2 | H2 |

**Content:**
