  <p class="wmd-paragraph">🔒 Your exact location is never shared — we only use it to determine your metro area.</p>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-button-primary">Enable Location</button>
  <button class="wmd-button wmd-secondary">Not Now</button>
</div>
