  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Create Event</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 16 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-03-05
<strong>Feature Spec:</strong> <a href="../../features/events.md">Events Feature</a>
<strong>Feature Breakdown:</strong> <a href="../../features/events-feature-breakdown.md">Events Breakdown — E4.1</a>
<strong>Story:</strong> As a verified (Level 1+) user, I want to create a community event so others in my metro area can discover and RSVP to it.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">A scrollable form for creating a new community event. Users fill in event details, pick a type, set dates/times, add an optional photo, and configure RSVP visibility. Premium users can toggle global visibility. The form validates inline and enables the submit button only when all required fields are valid.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Fast, guided event creation (&lt; 2 minutes for a typical event)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Mandatory type selection for feed filtering</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Optional photo and address for richer event pages</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">RSVP privacy control by organizer</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Premium global toggle for cross-metro reach</li>
</ul>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Visual Wireframe</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">State 1: Standard User (Level 1+) — Empty Form</h3>
