- All Location features (2.1-2.4)
- Basic Profile (3.1-3.3)
- Trust Level Core (4.1-4.4, 4.6)
- Post Engine Core (5.1-5.6)
- Tag System (5.14-5.15)
- Photo Upload Core (7.1-7.4)
- Chat Core (8.1-8.5)
- Reporting Core (9.1-9.2)
- Admin Core (10.1-10.3)
