<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>New table needed — device_tokens</strong> (to be added to 001_schema.sql):</p>
<pre class="wmd-code-block"><code>id, user_id, token (TEXT), platform (expo|web_push),
endpoint (TEXT, for web push), p256dh (TEXT), auth_key (TEXT),
created_at, last_used_at</code></pre>
