<h3 class="wmd-h3">Push Delivery Architecture</h3>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Mobile (Expo Push):</strong></p>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">App registers with Expo → gets ExponentPushToken[xxx]</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Token stored in device_tokens table</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Edge Function sends via https://exp.host/--/api/v2/push/send</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Handles APNs (iOS) + FCM (Android) transparently</li>
</ol>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Web (Web Push API):</strong></p>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Service worker subscribes → gets PushSubscription (endpoint + keys)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Subscription stored in device_tokens (endpoint, p256dh, auth columns)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Edge Function sends VAPID-signed push to browser endpoint</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Service worker push event handler shows notification</li>
</ol>
