  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>0 notifications shows empty state (not blank screen)</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Offline state shows cached list with offline banner</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Push permission denied shows in-app prompt to open settings</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Web push subscription updates if browser endpoint changes</span>
  </label></li>
</ul>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Open Questions</h2>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Should likes batch into a single notification (&quot;5 people liked your post&quot;) or show individually? → Rec: Batch when 5+ within 1 hour window</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Should there be a &quot;Clear all&quot; / delete-all option or just dismiss-per-item? → Rec: Start with dismiss-per-item only; clear-all in a later iteration</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Emergency notifications: Should web also show a persistent banner on the home feed (not just push)? → Rec: Yes, banner on HomeScreen too (Phase 2 Red Alert)</span>
  </label></li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item"><label class="wmd-checkbox">
    <input type="checkbox" />
    <span>Web push: Should service worker prompt appear on every sign-in or only the first? → Rec: First sign-in only, with 7-day cooldown on dismiss</span>
  </label></li>
</ul>
