<body class="wmd-root wmd-material">
  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Events List Screen</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 16 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-03-05
<strong>Feature Spec:</strong> <a href="../../features/events.md">events.md</a>
<strong>Breakdown:</strong> <a href="../../features/events-feature-breakdown.md">events-feature-breakdown.md</a>
<strong>Story:</strong> As a verified user, I want to browse upcoming community events in my metro area so I can discover, attend, and RSVP to events that interest me.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose + Key Goals</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">The Events List is the entry point to all community events. It replaces the current &quot;Coming Soon&quot; placeholder in the Events tab. Users see a chronological, filterable list of upcoming events in their metro area (plus global events).</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Surface local community events in a familiar, feed-style layout</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Enable quick filtering by event type (Cultural, Religious, Social, Career)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Let Level 1+ users RSVP directly from the list (via event detail)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Give organizers a clear path to create new events</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Degrade gracefully for Level 0 users (view-only)</li>
</ul>
