<h2 class="wmd-h2">Technical Notes</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Screen Identifiers</h3>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Mobile route: EventsScreen (in HomeStack, already registered)</li>
