<h2 class="wmd-h2">User Interactions</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Primary Flow (Browse &amp; Find Event)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps Events tab → sees upcoming events in their metro</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Cultural&quot; chip → list narrows to cultural events</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User finds &quot;Teej Festival 2026&quot;, taps card → navigates to Event Detail</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">On detail, user taps RSVP → confirms attendance</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Create Event, Level 1+)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Create Event&quot; button in header</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigates to Create Event form</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Fills in details, submits</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigated to new event&#039;s detail screen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Event appears in metro Events feed immediately</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Level 0 Attempts RSVP)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Level 0 user sees events list (no Create button, banner shown)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Taps event card → navigates to Event Detail</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">On detail, RSVP button shows &quot;Verify to RSVP&quot; prompt</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Tap → navigates to verification flow</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Filter, No Results)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Career&quot; chip</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">No career events in this metro</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Empty state shown: &quot;No upcoming Career events&quot; + &quot;Clear Filter&quot; button</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Clear Filter&quot; → &quot;All&quot; chip reactivates, full list restores</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Premium Location Switch)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Premium user taps metro name in header (has ▼ chevron)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Location switcher sheet opens (reuses existing location-switcher component)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User selects &quot;New York-Newark-Jersey City&quot; (a saved location)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Events list reloads with NYC events</li>
