<h2 class="wmd-h2">User Interactions</h2>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Primary Flow (View &amp; RSVP)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps event card in Events List → navigates to Event Detail (slide-in animation)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Screen loads with hero image, title, date/time, location, description</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User scrolls down to see organizer and attendance info</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;RSVP — I&#039;m Going&quot; button</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Button immediately flips to &quot;Going ✓&quot; (optimistic UI); count increments by 1</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Success alert appears: &quot;You&#039;re going! We&#039;ll remind you before the event.&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User can tap &quot;Can&#039;t make it&quot; → confirmation modal → removes RSVP</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Message Organizer)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;Message Organizer&quot; button</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If existing conversation with this organizer: opens that conversation</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">If new conversation: creates conversation, navigates to message thread</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Level 0 user: &quot;Verify to message&quot; taps → navigates to verification flow</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (View Organizer Profile)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps organizer avatar or name</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigates to organizer&#039;s Public Profile screen</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Shows organizer&#039;s events, posts, masked name, trust badge</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Edit Event — Organizer)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer taps ⋮ menu → &quot;Edit Event&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Navigates to Create Event form, pre-filled with current data</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer edits fields, saves</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Returns to Event Detail with updated content + &quot;Edited&quot; label</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Cancel Event — Organizer)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer taps ⋮ menu → &quot;Cancel Event&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Confirmation modal: &quot;Cancel this event? Attendees will see this event as cancelled.&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer taps &quot;Yes, Cancel It&quot; → event status set to &#039;cancelled&#039;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Detail screen updates: red &quot;Cancelled&quot; banner, strikethrough on title/date, RSVP button hidden</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (Delete Event — Organizer)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer taps ⋮ menu → &quot;Delete Event&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Confirmation modal (destructive): &quot;Delete this event? This permanently removes the event.&quot;</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Organizer taps &quot;Delete&quot; → navigated back to Events List; event no longer appears</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="wmd-h3">Alternative Flow (View Attendees)</h3>
<ol class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps &quot;View all attendees&quot; (public RSVP events only)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Attendee list modal/sheet slides up</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Scrollable list of masked names + avatars + trust badges</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">User taps a name → navigates to their public profile</li>
</ol>
