  <h1 class="wmd-h1">Wireframe: Event Detail Screen</h1>
<blockquote class="wmd-blockquote">
  <p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Screen:</strong> 17 | <strong>Status:</strong> Draft | <strong>Updated:</strong> 2026-03-05
<strong>Feature Spec:</strong> <a href="../../features/events.md">events.md</a>
<strong>Previous Screen:</strong> <a href="../16-events-list/16-events-list.md">16-events-list.md</a>
<strong>Story:</strong> As a verified user, I want to view full event details and RSVP so I can plan my attendance and let the organizer know I'm coming.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="wmd-separator" />
<h2 class="wmd-h2">Screen Purpose + Key Goals</h2>
<p class="wmd-paragraph">The Event Detail screen shows the complete information for a single event and is the primary surface for RSVPs. Users arrive by tapping an event card in the Events List.</p>
<p class="wmd-paragraph"><strong>Key Goals:</strong></p>
<ul class="wmd-list">
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Display all event information needed to decide whether to attend</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Enable RSVP with a single tap (Level 1+)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Surface organizer identity and provide a path to message them</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Show attendee list (public) or RSVP count (private)</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Give organizers access to edit, cancel, and delete actions</li>
  <li class="wmd-list-item">Handle past/cancelled events gracefully</li>
</ul>
